# Shared

Cross-cutting only. No module business rules.

## Zod / DTO

Zod lives in `@workspace/validation` (`user/`, `auth/`). Use-case and contract import those types; do not declare input/output types in the use-case file and do not duplicate schemas in `src/shared/dto/`.

## orpc/

- `authed.middleware.ts` — require `context.user`
- `map-app-error.middleware.ts` — `AppError` → `ORPCError` + `data.errorCode`
- `context.const.ts` — `OrpcContext`

Root router: `src/shared/router.const.ts` (`router.auth`, `AppRouter`).

## error/

- `AppError` subclasses + `ERROR_CODES` from `@workspace/server/shared/error/`

## DB

- `@workspace/database` — not inside the server package

```ts
export const mapAppErrorMiddleware = os.middleware(async ({ next }) => {
  try {
    return await next();
  } catch (error) {
    if (error instanceof AppError) {
      throw new ORPCError(error.code, {
        message: error.message,
        data: { errorCode: error.errorCode },
        cause: error,
      });
    }
    throw error;
  }
});
```
